        "filing_date": "2026-04-17",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "As a result of our direct ownership in our WFOEs and the contractual arrangements with the VIEs, we are regarded as the primary beneficiary of the VIEs, and we treat the VIEs and their subsidiaries as our consolidated entities under U.S.",
